Source: excalibur-control-center
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Muhammedsah Fidan <muhammedsahfidan@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, ninja-build, qt6-base-dev (>= 6.5)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/msahhf/excalibur-control-center
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: excalibur-control-center
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dkms
Recommends: excalibur-control-center-dkms
Description: Read-only hardware telemetry for CASPER EXCALIBUR laptops
 Native Qt6 desktop application that shows CPU/GPU temperature and fan RPM
 telemetry exposed through the Linux hwmon interface, plus diagnostics and a
 system tray. It is strictly read-only and never requires root.

Package: excalibur-control-center-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: excalibur-control-center, linux-headers-amd64 | linux-headers-generic
Description: excalibur-wmi read-only hwmon driver sources (DKMS)
 DKMS kernel module sources for the CASPER EXCALIBUR G870 (NLXB 001). The dkms
 framework builds the read-only hwmon module against each installed kernel.
 Requires the 7.2.x kernel WMI API (wmidev_set_block/query_block).
